$negprompts_to_prompts / $negprompts2prompts — move negprompts into prompts

SUMMARY
  Copies content from each negprompts[] link into prompts[] (one file per entry,
  or one joined file). Clears negprompts[] afterward. Bridges stored negative
  prompts back into the positive prompts array.

SYNTAX
  $negprompts_to_prompts
  $negprompts_to_prompts(join=1)

INPUT
  negprompts[] — source strings.

OUTPUT
  prompts[] — new links with the same text content.
  negprompts[] — cleared.

ARGUMENTS
  join=1 | true | yes — merge all negprompts into one prompts[] entry.

EXAMPLE
  @restore: neg_store% -> $negprompts_to_prompts -> $image(model='default')

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No (clears negprompts, not prompts).
